---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from "../lib/constants";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Refund policy"
  description="When Marked Pro payments can be refunded, and how cancelling works."
>
  <p>
    You can try Marked on the Free plan with no card and no time limit, and you
    can cancel Pro whenever you like. Because of that, Pro payments are
    generally not refundable once a billing period has started.
  </p>

  <h2>Cancelling</h2>
  <p>
    Cancel from the Billing page in the app. Cancelling stops future charges.
    You keep Pro until the end of the period you've already paid for. We don't
    give part refunds for unused time in that period.
  </p>

  <h2>When we will refund</h2>
  <p>We review these case by case and refund to the original payment method:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>You were charged twice for the same period.</li>
    <li>You were charged after you had cancelled.</li>
    <li>A fault on our side stopped you using Pro for the period you paid for.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Please ask within 14 days of the charge so we can check it properly. Refunds
    can take several working days to reach your account, depending on your bank.
  </p>

  <h2>Switching from monthly to yearly</h2>
  <p>
    When you switch to yearly, the yearly plan starts straight away and your
    monthly plan stops so you aren't billed twice. Days left on the current
    month aren't refunded.
  </p>

  <h2>Your legal rights</h2>
  <p>Nothing here limits any rights you have under the law.</p>

  {
    SUPPORT_EMAIL ? (
      <>
        <h2>How to ask</h2>
        <p>
          Email <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a> from the address on your
          account, with the date and amount of the charge.
        </p>
      </>
    ) : null
  }
</LegalLayout>